    "examples_total": 1024,
    "token_accounting": "Current input-token exposures match. Old input tokens and padded tokens can differ because retained replay rows differ; report realized counts without asserting a token match.",
    "evaluation": "Use all fixed 32-update endpoints, global logits over the same 16 learned letter codes, and the same 80 heldout test examples per task. No validation-selected checkpoint, early stopping, heldout-dependent retention or hyperparameter tuning."
  },
